{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2022-05-13 15:27:00', 'title': 'COLUMBIA GAS OF MARYLAND PROPOSES FURTHER INVESTMENTS IN SAFETY THROUGH REPLACING AND UPGRADING AGING INFRASTRUCTURE', 'text': "PLAN CREATES JOBS, SUPPORTS ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT, PROMOTES SUSTAINABILITY CANONSBURG, PA. , MAY 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COLUMBIA GAS OF MARYLAND, INC., A SUBSIDIARY OF NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI), FILED A REQUEST TODAY WITH THE MARYLAND PUBLIC SERVICE COMMISSION (PSC) TO APPROVE REVISED RATES FOR FURTHER UPGRADING AND REPLACING PORTIONS OF THE COMPANY'S UNDERGROUND NATURAL GAS DISTRIBUTION PIPELINES."}